# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data & derived artifacts — NOT part of this repository and NOT
# redistributable. The DIEM-A and AIDE datasets and ALL artifacts derived
# from them (skeletons, features, rationales, rendered motion, labels,
# splits, out-of-fold predictions, caches) are excluded under the DIEM-A
# User License Agreement and the AIDE license. See README "Data availability".
# These patterns keep such files from being committed by accident.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: leading slash anchors these to the repo root so they do NOT match
# source packages like diema/data/ or nested output dirs.
/data/
/input/
/output/
/outputs/
/checkpoints/
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bvh
*.c3d
*.mp4
*.pkl
*.parquet
